<title>USA: Fannie Mae increases REMIC 1997-07.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae increases REMIC 1997-07.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fannie Mae said it added about $370 million to a previously issued series of Real Estate Mortgage Investment Conduit (REMIC) securities.</p>
<p>REMIC trust 1997-07, issued via Salomon Inc, was increased to about $2.736 billion from $2.366 billion, Fannie Mae said.</p>
<p>The issue is backed by 30-year mortgage-backed securities with coupons of 7.5 and 8.0 percent, the agency said. It has a new settlement date of February 28.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
